                <pb facs="1272" n="1122" xml:id="pg1122"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Minister Hill to the Secretary of State.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Legation</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">The
                            Hague</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1907-04-18"><hi
                                rendition="#italic">April 18, 1907</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Hill states that the Government of the Netherlands substantially accepts
                    views in the telegram from the department of April 17. Full details to be given
                    in dispatch following.)</p>
            </div>
        </body>
